        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wicklow Homes present to the market this beautiful large 4 Bedroom House situated just outside of Callan town in Kilkenny. The property is a detached residence on 0.66acres, featuring entrance hall leading to large open plan Kitchen come Dining Room, adjoining Utility Room/Pantry with separate Home office/Second Dining Room, Large Sun room with Wood Burning Stove and Back Boiler, Velux Windows and tilt and turn Large Glass Windows and Double Doors leading to paved Garden Patio area, with Childrens playground and Pet Enclosure. Ground floor has one bedroom and large Family Bathroom/Wet Room with Walk in Shower, Double Vanity and a Bath, separate Guest WC.\r\n\r\nOutside features stone front parking area and concrete rear garden with Large Garage and 3 Bay Car Port with 2 Roller Garage Doors, Security CCTV and Electric Entrance Gates. Double Glazed windows throughout, Oil Central Heating, Private Septic Tank and Own Well. Solar Heated Water System."
      },
